### B2: OTC与补充剂推荐API测试

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@token = 你的JWT Token

### 1. 生成个性化推荐（通用）
POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### 2. 生成个性化推荐（血糖控制焦点）
POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "focus": "blood_sugar"
}

###

### 3. 生成个性化推荐（体重管理焦点）
POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "focus": "weight"
}

###

### 4. 获取用户推荐历史
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 5. 获取推荐详情
@recommendationId = 推荐ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/{{recommendationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 6. 提交推荐反馈
POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/{{recommendationId}}/feedback
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 5,
  "accepted": true,
  "comment": "推荐很有帮助，我会考虑使用维生素D3"
}

###

### 7. 搜索补充剂
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/supplements/search?query=维生素
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 8. 按分类搜索补充剂
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/supplements/search?category=血糖控制
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 9. 获取所有补充剂分类
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/supplements/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 10. 获取补充剂详情
@supplementId = 补充剂ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/supplements/{{supplementId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 11. 添加到关注列表
POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/watchlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplementId": "补充剂ID",
  "notes": "我想了解更多关于这个补充剂的信息",
  "targetPrice": 15.00
}

###

### 12. 获取关注列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/watchlist/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 13. 从关注列表移除
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/watchlist/{{supplementId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 完整测试流程
# 1. 首先登录获取token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

# 2. 生成推荐
# 3. 查看推荐详情
# 4. 添加到关注列表
# 5. 提交反馈

